WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:34.920
On the journey to find the legendary cookware,

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:37.120
Provincial Military Commander Li had a request.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.870
As a favor to him, we headed for Peking.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.180
According to Commander Li,

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.700
the Dark Cooking Society

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.390
has reached Peking.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.030
We need to hurry back.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:52.110
(Peking)

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.160
There are crowds everywhere!

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.710
But it doesn't feel the same

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.190
as in Guangzhou and Shanghai.

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:09.590
Move! Move!

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.590
Excuse me, are you Provincial Military Commander Li?

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:19.010
Yes.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.410
Please go with me to the Forbidden City.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.190
The Forbidden City?

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.980
Their welcome is earlier than expected.

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.740
It's truly the major center of Chinese cuisine.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.430
Commander Li is quite a big figure.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:32.810
Here is the order of His Majesty the Emperor.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:33.690
(Imperial Edict)

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.220
(The Emperor's Order)
Provincial Military Commander Li is to be disenfranchised,

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.480
and put into the Forbidden City’s Prison.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.990
He should ponder on his mistakes.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:41.930
What?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.010
What happened?

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:44.870
Silence!

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.070
This is from His Majesty the Emperor!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:49.530
Take him!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:50.290
Yes, sir!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:56.490
what’s going on?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.030
What on earth is going on?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.360
I am still too late.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.200
They have taken quick steps

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.190
to put Peking

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:05.980
under their control.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:11.480
Imperial Capital Peking! The Dark Cooking Society Bares Its Fangs

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:13.640
What do you think

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.740
Commander Li has done wrong?

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.430
Please let me see Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.370
What kind of place do you think this is?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:22.110
This is the Forbidden City where the Emperor lives!

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:23.850
It's not a place

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.410
for you guys to come in.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.770
Just go away!

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:27.830
What of it?

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.500
You stupid pig!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.540
What did you say?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.390
If you want to involve violence,

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.090
I don't mind.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:39.260
You!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.530
You'd better think it through.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.810
Think whether I will strike hard on your heads

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.680
with this iron bar.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.070
My Lords.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.410
What did you bring today?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.400
We have some food

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.430
and some daily supplies.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.380
Fine. You can go inside.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:55.980
Thank you.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.090
Alright, you gatekeepers.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.060
What do you say?

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:01.510
Calm down.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.590
If we get in trouble now,

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.800
we can't save Commander Li.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:06.890
You're right.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.230
Forget it.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:09.730
Sorry for bothering you.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.460
What was that for!

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:37.520
Silang, what are you doing?

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:38.310
Here it is.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:39.490
My instincts told me

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:40.600
that it should be around this area.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:41.710
Really?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:48.020
Silang, did you see Commander Li?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.440
Where is he?

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.720
So nice!

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:03.700
You're just awful!

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.000
Even you are totally attracted to them!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.990
I am not!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.150
You pervert!

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.120
Don't do that!

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:12.740
Who is it?

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.600
Go away!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.120
What's going on?

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:18.800
You guys!

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.730
Silang, run!

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.190
Get them!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.350
Freeze!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.540
Silang, it's all your fault!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:31.940
You enjoyed it too!

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.840
I didn't!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.680
Hey, you stop there!

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:43.460
Got you!

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.090
Those bastards!

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.620
Stop running!

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.170
Oh, no.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.740
Mao, what should we do?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.670
Are they here?

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.320
That's it.

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:35.070
This vase

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.490
can hold three people.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.380
We're dead.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.970
We will lose our heads!

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:57.890
No!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:58.810
Mao!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.650
Come out now,

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.360
or I will cut you in half.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.150
Stop!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.270
What are you doing here?

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:18.220
Well…

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.140
There are…

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.300
How dare you do anything

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:22.390
to these important vases

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:23.460
that will be used

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:26.310
by His Majesty the Emperor!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.470
Looks like you want to get killed!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.000
We're very sorry!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.540
Go back to your stations right now!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:32.590
Yes, sir!

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:34.990
We're safe!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.160
Alright. Carry them outside!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.310
Be careful.

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:40.140
Yes, sir!

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.150
I am starved.

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.040
I want something delicious!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.800
I just want once

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.340
to taste the imperial food

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.950
served to His Majesty.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.290
Speaking of which,

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.720
this time the royal kitchen

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:56.800
made an exception

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.770
for a young chef.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.650
The royal kitchen hired a new chef.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.930
Mao, let's go outside!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:15.740
I am not feeling well.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.200
Wait. It doesn't seem to be the right time.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.160
Here comes His Majesty the Emperor!

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.190
The Emperor? So we…

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:23.590
It seems that we're now at a place

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.770
that we're not allowed to be.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:41.320
Now His Majesty is going to preside

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.700
over the swearing-in ceremony

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.380
of the new Royal Chef!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.470
Mao,

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:49.290
the royal kitchen is where the Emperor's food is made,

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:49.950
isn't it?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.320
Becoming a Royal Chef

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.090
is the greatest honor

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.680
to every cook in China.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.400
So that guy

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.060
is the No.1 cook in China?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.410
Impressive!

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.650
He is a Super Chef like you!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.820
This is the appointment letter signed by His Majesty.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:15.060
From now on,

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.670
you must live up to your name

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.600
as the Royal Chef!

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:20.250
Yes, sir!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:28.140
He is…

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.710
How can it be!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.070
The new chef

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.660
is from the Dark Cooking Society!

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.220
We must stop that.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.030
I will bear it in mind and work hard.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:37.780
Please stop the ceremony.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.730
Listen, everybody.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.350
The new chef is,

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:50.480
Your Majesty…

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.350
Shut your mouth, boy!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.900
Who do you think you are speaking to?

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:54.880
Let go of me!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.770
Your majesty, please listen to me.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:00.430
This man uses food

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.470
to control your mind.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.480
He is from the Dark Cooking Society!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.060
The Dark Cooking Society?

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.070
What are you talking about?

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.210
How bold you are!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.050
It's not the time

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.270
for that talk!

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.130
Right!

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:15.400
How can you hire someone from the Dark Cooking Society

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.260
to be a Royal Chef?

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.470
Things will go out of control!

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.800
Be quiet!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:20.810
Why are you standing there?

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.360
Take them away!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:22.900
Yes!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:23.730
Your Majesty,

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.600
you can send for Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.810
He knows all about the scheme

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:28.740
of the Dark Cooking Society!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:32.930
You Majesty, believe me.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.320
It hurts! Let go of me!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.240
Don't get tricked, you fool!

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:38.760
You guys know nothing

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.350
about cooking.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.440
Don't talk nonsense!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:45.300
What? I know nothing about cooking?

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:49.640
(Super Chef)

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:53.800
What?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.440
Super Chef!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.560
Are you surprised?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.710
This is Mao,

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.320
the youngest Super Chef

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.250
of all times!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.430
Didn't expect that

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.260
we would meet here,

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:15.780
Mao.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:24.980
Fei!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.930
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:34.850
It's Fei!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:38.330
Who is that guy?

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:39.410
He is Lan Feihong,

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.710
who passed the Super Chef Test in Guangzhou

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:44.510
together with Mao.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:45.830
But back then,

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.580
he helped Mao a lot.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.550
Who knows he would belong

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.440
to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:53.800
Your name is Mao, right?

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.270
You don't need

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:57.980
to stop our ceremony

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.140
even if you're a Super Chef.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:00.950
Fei and I won

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.270
the Beijing Cooking Contest

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:05.390
the first time we attended.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.830
We're talented.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:12.330
We beat the chefs from the state-owned restaurants.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.710
More importantly,

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.590
we beat the former Royal Chefs too.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.880
Fei is the top chef in China.

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:22.540
What's wrong with him

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.250
being the new Royal Chef?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.930
Why would Fei join the Dark Cooking Society?

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.070
Tell me why, Fei.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:31.890
Listen, Mao.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:33.830
Now I am the Royal Chef

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.710
at the service of His Majesty.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:40.100
Right. You're just a Super Chef.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.960
You're in no position to call him by name.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.740
Mao, are you okay?

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:44.430
Mao!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:47.900
Alright! Don't just stand there!

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:49.780
Get them out!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:50.660
Yes.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.880
What are you doing? Let go!

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.590
We are not finished!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.950
Get away! You're hurting me!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.070
Get away!

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.290
Quit moving,

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.190
or you'll be dead!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.010
Wait!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:09.420
I have heard

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.810
that there is this youngest Super Chef

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.340
in Guangzhou.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:20.380
That's you, Mao.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.950
Your majesty,

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.570
if you give me a chance,

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.200
I'll prove to you

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:29.460
that this man from the Dark Cooking Society

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:30.440
is not the one who cooks

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.710
the nicest food in China.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.130
What is Mao doing…

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:36.740
Cool! That's what we call a man!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.100
Please.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.740
You must tell

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:45.910
the difference between my food

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.150
and Fei's.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:48.240
Then,

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:49.850
you will know what I mean.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.430
A cooking competition?

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.800
That sounds pretty interesting.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.650
Mao, don't push your luck!

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.230
Don't give your bad idea!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.170
Here's the swearing-in ceremony

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.700
of the new Royal Chef!

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:06.760
Majordomo Long.

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:07.770
Yes, Your Majesty!

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:09.830
Let's have the ceremony

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:10.720
after the competition.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:12.930
But…

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.010
Your Majesty,

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.890
If Your Majesty has made up your mind,

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.120
I, Lan Feihong, will take the challenge

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.050
and compete with Liu Maoxing.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.810
Wait.

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:29.030
Do the two of you know

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.160
the rules for a cooking competition here?

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.310
The defeated one

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.700
will not only lose his title of Super Chef,

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.110
but also won't be allowed to cook again.

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:38.120
I surely know.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:41.570
I am well-prepared.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.930
Alright! That's final.

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.930
Majordomo Long, go get everything prepared.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.120
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.720
Mao, are you sure about that?

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:55.090
It will be terrible if you lose.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:55.610
Mao!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.890
Okay, you two.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.710
The Royal Cooking Competition will be held

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.820
on the day after tomorrow

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.100
in the Forbidden City.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.090
Are you clear?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.060
Yes.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.580
You'll have yourself to blame.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:14.780
Fei.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.740
You proposed to the Emperor

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.260
that you want a royal cooking competition?

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:27.610
It suits you, Mao.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.440
That's the thing you do.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.120
Sorry for being so capricious.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.290
But, Chef Xie and you guys

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:35.730
will help me, won't you?

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.660
Our rival is made of three.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:39.080
of course, we will help you.

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:40.560
Don't sweat it.

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:41.940
Right, Lei En?

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.060
Sure!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:45.660
The Dark Cooking Society

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:48.270
have gone way further than we thought.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:51.240
They have put Commander Li into prison.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:54.980
He is a prominent official in the Chinese Cooking Society.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.960
And they have taken the position of

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:58.630
the Royal Chef.

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.610
Looks like

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.410
they have people work for them

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.690
in the Forbidden City.

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:06.190
Otherwise, they couldn't have taken

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.480
such a big step.

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.600
But this time, our rivals aren't the same

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.430
as those in the past.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:13.830
They are

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:16.330
the winners of the Beijing Cooking Competition.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.820
They are really talented.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.180
If you lose,

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.850
you will lose your title of Super Chef.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.500
And you three

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.100
can't cook in the future.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.610
That's the same for our rivals.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.220
That is to say,

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.950
if we win the competition,

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.120
we can destroy the scheme

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.970
of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.560
That's right!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.010
You guys don't need to worry.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.800
To take part in

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.000
the Royal Cooking Competition in Beijing

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.290
is a big feat!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:45.960
I can't wait.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:49.870
I can't lose

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.400
the competition,

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:53.150
no matter who I am against.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.480
Conventionally,

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:05.980
the theme of the Royal Cooking Competition

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.620
is decided by the Emperor himself.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.110
But I can sound it out.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:12.370
It would be great.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:15.440
Don't forget

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:16.890
the deal we made earlier.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:18.410
Sure.

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.500
We will need your help

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.440
in the future.

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.100
When the Dark Cooking Society

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.910
take control of the who country…

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.460
We should be paid…

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:32.170
I am looking forward to that day!

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:39.740
Why are you up to such a despicable thing?

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:40.850
It only distracts you

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.610
from preparing for the competition.

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:45.070
Just in case.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.390
This is my cooking competition.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.330
Don't play dirty!

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:52.230
I will leave it to you.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:53.140
I'm off now.

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.620
I can't stand him.

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:00.920
Don't mind him, Yang Shi.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:03.310
We need his talent for now.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:04.710
Just for now.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:59.980
The Royal Cooking Competition is about to begin.

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.580
Please welcome the two groups.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.600
Mao, go for it!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.280
Go! I am here with you!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.080
I will be here praying for you!

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.000
Mao!

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:28.780
Zhou Yu, Master Ruoh,

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.650
you came from Guangzhou for my competition!

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:40.030
This is not only a challenge to
the Chinese Cooking Society.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:43.110
It's also about the life and death of this country,

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:44.840
about its fate.

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:47.450
It all depends on Mao.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.580
Fight for it, Mao!

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:57.230
Fei, we are here!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.390
So long!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:04.050
Traitor Lei En!

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:05.540
You two!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:07.920
Lei En, do you know them?

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:09.350
They are

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.850
the Super Chefs of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:11.990
They're called Chef.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.200
One of them is Mantis Ghost Yang Shi, good with knives.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.110
The other is Double-tailed Scorpion Lai He,
skilled at fire.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.600
They are the Super Chefs of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:22.980
Chef.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:24.150
Alright.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:26.510
First, I must inform you

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.300
of the theme of the competition.

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:32.460
According to the convention,

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:35.570
the theme will be announced by His Majesty the Emperor.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.750
Please listen up.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:41.840
The theme is

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:50.330
any delicious Chinese cuisine.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.650
Just make 100 dishes.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.770
100 dishes?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.340
Please note that

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:00.670
you can't keep His Majesty waiting.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.090
So all dishes should be finished

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.440
within three hours.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:07.930
What? Three hours?

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.590
His Majesty demands 100 dishes be made in three hours!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.300
I declare the Hundred-Dish Royal Cooking Competition

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:16.320
starts now!

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:17.410
Yes, sir.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:18.200
Yes, sir.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:26.120
Fei, go!

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:26.820
Come on!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.040
Mao, you can do it!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.390
Mao, go!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.830
You're sure to lose!

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:42.970
I must stop the scheme

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.340
of the Dark Cooking Society!

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:45.590
Let's combat!

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.470
Chefs, and Fei!

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:19.664
To finish a hundred dishes in just three hours?

00:23:19.977 --> 00:23:22.089
I don't know what I'm going to make.

00:23:22.597 --> 00:23:26.492
As we pondered, Fei and the others
continued to prepare their dishes.

00:23:27.122 --> 00:23:28.594
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.849 --> 00:23:30.352
Secret Plan of Fei the Genius!

00:23:30.458 --> 00:23:31.970
New Man-Han Imperial Feast

00:23:32.083 --> 00:23:33.151
It will definitely be interesting!
